{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e15-scene-04",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "突然发布的免职公告  (The Sudden Demotion Notice)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "bu_xiaogu": "布小谷",
    "xiaoye": "小叶",
    "agent": "经纪人"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "At Xingtian's bulletin board, Bu Xiaogu and Xiaoye stare in shock at an official company notice demoting Chun Yuqiao effective immediately. Listen to their Mandarin conversation.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "因恣意操控节目制作，造成不良影响。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "免去淳于乔星天娱乐首席内容官职权。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "并予减薪百分之五十，即日生效。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这操控节目制作，不是那个艺人的事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小叶，这到底是怎么回事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "魔鬼鱼该不是为了帮你出头吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，我到处找都找不着淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你要是看到我的留言，赶紧给我回个电话啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，请问您看到淳于总了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你们大家都先别慌。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "因恣意操控节目制作，造成不良影响。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'For arbitrarily manipulating show production and causing a negative impact.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "免去淳于乔星天娱乐首席内容官职权。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao is relieved of his authority as Chief Content Officer of Xingtian.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "并予减薪百分之五十，即日生效。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'His salary is also cut by fifty percent, effective today.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这操控节目制作，不是那个艺人的事吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Manipulating show production—was this not about that troublesome artist?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小叶，这到底是怎么回事啊？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xiaoye, what on earth is going on here?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "魔鬼鱼该不是为了帮你出头吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Could Manta Ray have gotten into this because he stood up for you?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，我到处找都找不着淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Xingzi, I have looked everywhere and still cannot find Chun Yuqiao.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你要是看到我的留言，赶紧给我回个电话啊。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'As soon as you see my message, please call me right back.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，请问您看到淳于总了吗？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Hello, excuse me—have you seen Chun Yuqiao?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你们大家都先别慌。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Everyone stay calm first.'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "因恣意操控节目制作，造成不良影响。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "免去淳于乔星天娱乐首席内容官职权。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "并予减薪百分之五十，即日生效。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "这操控节目制作，不是那个艺人的事吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "小叶，这到底是怎么回事啊？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "魔鬼鱼该不是为了帮你出头吧？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "杏子姐，我到处找都找不着淳于总。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "你要是看到我的留言，赶紧给我回个电话啊。",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "bu_xiaogu",
      "t": "喂，您好，请问您看到淳于总了吗？",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "agent",
      "t": "你们大家都先别慌。",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Fearing Chun Yuqiao took the punishment for standing up for her, Bu Xiaogu leaves urgent messages trying to track him down. See you next time!",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xiaoye",
      "t": "回头见！",
      "gap": 0.3
    }
  ],
